.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.import_linter_cache
**/*.egg-info
docs
deploy
pocs
.claude
.env
.env.*
# A `.env` anywhere in the tree (deploy/compose/.env holds the real keys) never enters a context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
# echo-typescript builds from its own folder with its own .dockerignore; the Python images never
# copy it, so its node_modules and build output stay out of the repo-root context.
**/node_modules
packages/workloads/echo-typescript/dist
# No image runs its tests, recorded cassettes, or logs.
packages/**/tests
**/.hypothesis
**/cassettes
**/*.log
